Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,One celestial jade !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he crazy !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is he ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare he humiliate the Whole Treasure Pavilion !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.15,Second,,0,0,0,,He really made a bid...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with such a price,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,if we accept it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Whole Treasure Pavilion will lose face...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would basically tell everyone that something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if we refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would go against the Ancestor's orders...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:24.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Xu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're brilliant !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:33.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,since fellow cultivator is the only bidder,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's sold !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The grade 8 pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,for one celestial jade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,goes to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Goes to this fellow cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's sold !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could the pavilion agree to that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a grade 8 pseudo divine pill !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could the Whole Treasure Pavilion treat this so casually !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If fellow cultivator Sun has nothing else,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,In there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,are over 50 000 celestial jades I've saved over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are also records of my alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,, and artifact refining experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hoped that one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might find an opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to recover some of my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I have no use for them anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm giving them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Strength and weakness...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kindness and resentment...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cause and effect...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old slave Sun Tai greets Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Karma...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this what comes after
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle Domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the essence of Life and Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was the cause
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and today is the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Tai ended up here because of me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and also found peace because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1645,456)\fad(300,300)}Wasteland\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nearly 300 000 celestial jades
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be barely enough to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:04:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such might...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he warning us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have enough celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only need enlightenment in my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to finish this breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,and reach Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since they insisted on dragging me into this matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,then they must show me their goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,My performance just now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:06:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be enough for these three
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,to understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,He had a breakthrough !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me test you !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial guard...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he wanted to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,that palm strike he used
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,would have already destroyed my body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,What cultivation level does this person have ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak Late stage Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,even higher !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you are one of those that schemed to drag me down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It... It was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:05.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just that the Huan Family is too overbearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and resorted to this scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no time for your excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want my protection,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,your sincerity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far from enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does fellow cultivator mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want 90% of your family's celestial jades.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You two
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,can come out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,will hand 70%.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:34.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Carefree Xanren, Zhao Chuanwen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,will hand over 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want the remaining grade 8 pills you obtained 4 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with the belongings of that Huan Family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:50.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must hand it over
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,without a single missing piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I still lack celestial jades for my cultivation in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,your three families
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be responsible for finding them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can't do all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you can pray for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,These
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,are my conditions for protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you accept
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,or reject them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sun Family accepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as we have your protection
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and safely survive this calamity,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll give you myself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,70% of our celestial jades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ran Family
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,also accepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We only hope you will keep your promise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and protect the Ran Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we attacked together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the ambush back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't think you can stay out of this !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are all involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't escape this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,also agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,My family is small,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,these meager savings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,are my entire wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family member's belongings are all in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't disturb me unless something important happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Huan Family comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will act by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This identity token is too plain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,There really is something wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The material is ordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,but there is a spell linked to the Life Soul inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,is already aware this person is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,On Planet Yun Xia,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I discovered a vein
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,of flame metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,An entire vein of flame metal !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:38.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Defying Bead is only missing the metal element
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be complete and recognize me as its Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Xi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,engrave a map of planets you know in the Allheaven Star System onto a jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and send it to me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Yun Xia...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This flame metal vein
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,is mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you leaving Planet Ran Yun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this matter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a matter of life or death for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family's threat is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not go back
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,on what I have promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:41.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're here !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family really came !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am a rank 2 guard of the Huan Family of Planet Thousand Illusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ascendant cultivators of Planet Ran Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,come to pay your respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you interfere with the Huan Family's affairs ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're unworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,of knowing my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of lightning is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is definitely not Middle stage Ascendant !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fleeing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must escape
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and report to my lady !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you dare to oppose my Huan Family !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't release me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will die for sure !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huan Family's vengeance is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can't resist it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Xu Mu is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Huan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,what business do you have on our Planet Ran Yun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,What business ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ran Family Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should know very well !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:14:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you really are the ones that killed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Huan Family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ran Xuefeng,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Xi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhao Chuanwen !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bloodlines of your three families
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,have come to an end !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,will you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,let us handle this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Huan Family Ancestor is back !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you act like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You surely don't think that you can oppose the Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,with your Ascendant cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the cultivation level
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Huan Family Ancestor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor's cultivation has reached the second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Several thousand years ago, he was already at the Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can handle this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have important matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the personal guard of Miss Huan Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,My lady
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the core disciple the Ancestor brought back from the Alliance !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you harm me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Miss Huan Mei will never let you off !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Mei !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was her original name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you spare me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Search !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This woman really gained a great fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,by coming to this Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,now that Huan Dong is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Huan Family will surely investigate !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will come back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,in 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Lamp of Huan Dong has gone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The location of his death
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Planet Ran Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please give the order, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Send forces to Planet Ran Yun !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destroy the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,extinguish their bloodlines !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destroy the planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,extinguish their bloodlines !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a small place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Destroying it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is as easy as flipping my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Huan Dong
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,is one of Huan Mei's underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This vengeance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be personally carried out by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor is wise
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,but Miss Huan Mei's blood exchange ritual is not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then finish it early !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the blood exchange ritual is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,let Huan Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,personally handle this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the Ancestor orders !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Issue the order,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one can leave Planet Ran Yun !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Set up the Star Sealing Grand Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allow entry but not exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not even an ant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,is allowed to escape from me !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,800)\pos(1671,431)}Planet Yun Xia
Dialogue: 100,0:18:17.04,0:20:50.91,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}Sun Tai pondered for a long time before standing up. He looked out the window and softly said, “You… Can you promise me something?”\NWang Lin didn’t open his eyes and calmly said, “Speak.”\N\N“If you really send me off in 20 years, please take my ashes back to the Alliance Star System’s planet Dark Moon. There is a mountain that pierces into the sky. I remember there being a village at the foot of the mountain. Please send my ashes back there.”\NWang Lin let out a sigh, then he opened his eyes and nodded at Sun Tai.\N\NSun Tai revealed a smile of gratitude. At this moment, he was like a mortal old man who wanted to return to his roots after he died and not become a foreign ghost.\NHe took out a bag of holding, slowly put it down, and said, “Here are some celestial jades. I been saving them for the day when I recover my cultivation, but after seeing you, I feel like I don’t need them anymore. There are also records of my alchemy and artifact refining experiences. Take them as my thanks for sending his old man home.”\N\NGiving away his bag of holding was him loosening a knot in his heart. It meant that he had given up on recovering and had given up on everything, including the unwillingness he felt for the hundreds of years he had spent here.\NIt was because of Wang Lin that he ended up with such a fate, but also because of Wang Lin that he was relieved of the pain in his soul for hundreds of years. If there was karma, this was it.\N\NThe sun setted and Wang Lin closed his eyes. Life and death, karmatic cause and karmatic effect are only separated by just one thought, much like Yin and Yang, true and false.\NThis was the way the world was.\N“Karma is the path after the Life and Death Domain. It can be said that karma is the root of life and death; it is because there is a karmatic cause of life that there is a karmatic effect of life.” Wang Lin felt a hint of enlightenment, but everything still felt foreign. It was as if he could see it but not touch it.
