Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:09.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:09.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:16.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:16.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:22.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.23,0:19:22.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:29.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:29.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:33.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:33.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:37.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:37.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:43.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
